            "detailed_description": "You have submitted yourself as a test subject. <br>You are now locked inside a box. <br>The only way to go is down.<br><br>Complete a series of puzzles. <br>Receive prizes and praise for <br>completing each challenge.<br>Build up pride and wealth and<br>revel in your achievements.<br><br>How much is enough?<br>Keep chasing treasure and <br>descend further into the abyss.<br>What is at the bottom of it all? <br><br>While engaged in routine tasks, <br>lost to struggles against time and space, <br>how will you escape captivation <br>to free your mind and heart? <br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><br>This game was built and designed specifically for room scale VR.<br>Physics simulated object interactions.<br>Immersive hand presence using motion tracked VR controllers.<br>Simple, intuitive controls.<br>Clean, minimal visual style.<br><br><strong>CONTENT:</strong><br><br>10 challenging levels.<br>17 puzzles total.<br>This game is intended to be completed in a single session.<br>Note that progress will not be saved after the application quits.<br><br><strong>REQUIREMENTS:</strong><br><br>This game requires a room scale VR setup.<br>You will need a minimum 2x2 meter square<br>play space, and full 360 degree freedom <br>of movement. <br><br>Supported VR hardware includes: <br>Index, Vive, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest 2(with Oculus link).",
